ms (line 39)\n- **No tabs** — single unified list view of all bookmarked items across all content types\n- Page title: `.title(String.bookmark)` (line 128)\n- List divider enabled: `.divider(ThemeConst.ListDivider)` (line 123)\n- **No explicit `.id()` set** on major components (List, ListItem, Column don't have IDs)\n\n**List item rendering:**\n- Each item is a **ListItem** containing an **Item component** (lines 41-115)\n- **Item component** (lines 136-160):\n  - Shows **BlockTitle** (model/category label) + **Text** (content preview)\n  - `Text(this.content)` displays content with `.maxLines(2)` and ellipsis overflow (lines 143-147)\n  - Fields shown: model name (as category) + content text (no separate author field visible in Item)\n  \n**Supported content types** (8 types currently):\n```\n- PrefConst.CHINESE_ANTITHETICALCOUPLET → displays chinese_antitheticalcouplet.body\n- PrefConst.CHINESE_CHARACTER → displays chinese_character.character\n- PrefConst.CHINESE_EXPRESSION → displays chinese_expression.word\n- PrefConst.CHINESE_IDIOM → displays chinese_idiom.word\n- PrefConst.CHINESE_KNOWLEDGE → displays chinese_knowledge.content\n- PrefConst.CHINESE_QUOTE → displays chinese_quote.content\n- PrefConst.CLASSICALLITERATURE_CLASSICPOEM → displays classicalliterature_classicpoem.title\n- PrefConst.CLASSICALLITERATURE_SENTENCE → displays classicalliterature_sentence.content\n```\n\n**Navigation on click** (lines 42-114):\n- Uses `.onClick()` and `pushPathByName()` with route names:\n  - `'AntitheticalCoupletShowPage'` (line 49)\n  - `'CharacterShowPage'` (line 58)\n  - `'ExpressionShowPage'` (line 68)\n  - `'IdiomShowPage'` (line 77)\n  - `'KnowledgeShowPage'` (line 85)\n  - `'QuoteShowPage'` (line 94)\n  - `'ClassicPoemShowPage'` (line 102)\n  - `'SentenceShowPage'` (line 111)\n- Parameters: `new ParamNumberId(repeatItem.item.bookmarkable_id)` (passes only the content ID)\n\n**Routing config:** [`/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec7/features/bookmark/src/main/resources/base/profile/route_map.json`](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec7/features/bookmark/src/main/resources/base/profile/route_map.json)\n```json\n\"name\": \"BookmarkIndexPage\",\n\"pageSourceFile\": \"src/main/ets/pages/IndexPage.ets\",\n\"buildFunction\": \"IndexPageBuilder\"\n```\n\n**Module exports:** [`/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec7/features/bookmark/Index.ets`](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec7/features/bookmark/Index.ets)\n```typescript\nexport { addBookmark, cancelBookmark, getBookmark, Bookmark } from './src/main/ets/model/Bookmark';\n```\n\n**Module config:** [`/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec7/features/bookmark/src/main/module.json5`](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec7/features/bookmark/src/main/module.json5) (line 10)\n```json\n\"routerMap\": \"$profile:route_map\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. **Data Model & Storage (Database)**\n\n**Data models:**\n\n1. **Bookmark.ets** ([`/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec7/features/bookmark/src/main/ets/model/Bookmark.ets`](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec7/features/bookmark/src/main/ets/model/Bookmark.ets)):\n- 3-column model (lines 11-13):\n  ```typescript\n  id: number;\n  bookmarkable_id: number;\n  bookmarkable_model: string;\n  ```\n- Stores only ID and model type, **NOT** content snapshot\n\n2. **BookmarkEntity.ets** ([`/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec7/features/bookmark/src/main/ets/model/BookmarkEntity.ets`](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec7/features/bookmark/src/main/ets/model/BookmarkEntity.ets)):\n- **Denormalized view entity** with all content fields (lines 9-46):\n  ```typescript\n  id, bookmarkable_id, bookmarkable_model,\n  chinese_antitheticalcouplet, chinese_character, chinese_expression,\n  chinese_idiom, chinese_knowledge, chinese_quote,\n  classicalliterature_classicpoem, classicalliterature_sentence\n  ```\n- Used for disp