\n\n测试时留在模拟器上的收藏有：《时间情缘》、《幻象》、\"分房制度被取消\"、\"织布机上的梭子\"、\"四月八…\"、《长恨歌》，加上原来的 4 条成语。我没有删，后面实现时可以直接拿来验证。\n\nU1–U10 这几项歧义还等你定，确认后我开始写 1-do 阶段的实现。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1792033468850},{"id":"9cb10a92-715e-4be5-88b5-c7fd8301c305","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"这是对歧义的澄清，先据此修改  @acceptance.md   文档：U1: a. 保持基线\nU2: b. 再加 谚语/诗文/人物（所有有收藏按钮但未展示的类型）\nU3: 沿用各模块自己 BookmarkPage 的写法\nU4: a. 单独 Text = `writer`\nU5: b. 改成稳定的\"最新在前\"\nU6: a. 保持空白\nU7: a. 保留\nU8: 两处\nU9: b. 查询层去重\nU10: b. 收藏插入改用不传 id（自增）或毫秒时间戳","payload":{"query":"这是对歧义的澄清，先据此修改  @acceptance.md   文档：U1: a. 保持基线\nU2: b. 再加 谚语/诗文/人物（所有有收藏按钮但未展示的类型）\nU3: 沿用各模块自己 BookmarkPage 的写法\nU4: a. 单独 Text = `writer`\nU5: b. 改成稳定的\"最新在前\"\nU6: a. 保持空白\nU7: a. 保留\nU8: 两处\nU9: b. 查询层去重\nU10: b. 收藏插入改用不传 id（自增）或毫秒时间戳","rawMessage":"这是对歧义的澄清，先据此修改 $[acceptance.md](file:spec/acceptance.md)  文档：U1: a. 保持基线\nU2: b. 再加 谚语/诗文/人物（所有有收藏按钮但未展示的类型）\nU3: 沿用各模块自己 BookmarkPage 的写法\nU4: a. 单独 Text = `writer`\nU5: b. 改成稳定的\"最新在前\"\nU6: a. 保持空白\nU7: a. 保留\nU8: 两处\nU9: b. 查询层去重\nU10: b. 收藏插入改用不传 id（自增）或毫秒时间戳","model":{"displayName":"opus 5.5","modelId":"Opus 5.5_143_69ecd21d3a3e213032bd925cfe9637c5","requestType":"COMATE_MULTIPLE_MODE","mode":"NORMAL","effort":"high"},"agent":{"agentId":12,"agentName":"Spec","agentImage":"spec"},"metrics":{"model":"Spec","function":""},"knowledgeList":[{"id":"spec/acceptance.md","name":"spec/acceptance.md","type":"FILE"}],"isCurrentFileSelected":true,"sendMode":"normal","clientRequestId":"85fbdb72-4dfd-4d90-b403-e01071e5648e","requestedAt":1792034030174,"localPermissionMode":"rule-auto","codex":{"startGoal":false,"startPlan":false,"compact":false}},"discard":false,"context":{"conversationId":7003440,"taskId":12041581,"capabilitySnapshot":{"version":1,"skillFingerprint":"fb943ec5543cbba8e4afb5d113516a5bc6e87121","subAgentsFingerprint":"fd5f5328b64d04b5298af7f280460d92b7f026b2","sentNestedSkillKeys":[]},"taskReminderInjected":true},"disabledRollback":false,"appliedRules":[],"devic