 Agent 会话通常没有这条记录。如实告诉用户\"未找到 Spec 会话记录\"。普通会话的侧边栏 ID 是否等于引擎 sessionUuid **未经验证**，不要把两者说成同一个值。\n- `engine ... NOT FOUND`：hook 日志不存在或没有该工作区的记录（可能 hook 未启用或日志轮转）。告知用户即可，不要转而全盘搜索。\n\n## 数据来源（供解释与排错）\n\n| 值 | 位置 | 识别方式 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 引擎 sessionUuid | `~/.comate/builtin-hook-state/notify-dispatcher.log`（JSON 行） | 每次工具调用后有 `start`（含 `event=PostToolUse`、`conversationId`）→ `loadWatch`（含 `cwd`）→ `record`（含 `toolName`/`skillName`）三条；按 `cwd` 过滤工作区 |\n| 侧边栏会话 ID | `<IDE 用户目录>/workspaceStorage/<hash>/state.vscdb`，表 `ItemTable`，key `comateAgentEditor.session.<id>` | `<hash>` 目录下 `workspace.json` 的 `folder` 指向当前工作区；value 是 JSON，含 `sessionId`、`title`、`iconStatus`、`updatedAt` |\n\nIDE 用户目录：macOS `~/Library/Application Support/Comate/User`，Linux `~/.config/Comate/User`，Windows `%APPDATA%\\Comate\\User`。\n\n不要把 `User/History/` 或 `chatEditingSessions/` 里出现的 ID 当作依据：那些是 IDE 的本地历史和编辑快照，可能来自其他会话写过的文件，原文件删掉后快照依然存在。\n","metadata":{"relativePath":"/Users/bress/.comate/skills/comate-session-ids/SKILL.md","absolutePath":"/Users/bress/.comate/skills/comate-session-ids/SKILL.md","resolution":"absolute","skillName":"comate-session-ids","skillPath":"/Users/bress/.comate/skills/comate-session-ids"}}}]},{"id":"6ad32c354cf4dd3ab82a9f69","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":5756},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01AonvLX4dBkDsPbcwDzdWCk","type":"TOOL","toolName":"run_command","params":{"command":"time python3 ~/.comate/skills/comate-session-ids/scripts/session_ids.py \"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec7\"","description":"Run session ID script on this workspace","prefix_rule":"[\"python3\",\"/Users/bress/.comate/skills/comate-session-ids/scripts/session_ids.py\"]"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Command executed successfully.\nExit code: 0\nOutput:\nworkspace: /Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec7\nengine sessionUuid: aedc580f-d83d-4bd4-809a-64b398e1b786  [skill-invocation event, 6s ago]\nsidebar session ID: 1791984936543-